CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'vmcs12->host_rip'
#1553: FILE: arch/x86/kvm/vmx/nested.c:2898:
+		if (CC(vmcs12->vm_entry_controls & VM_ENTRY_IA32E_MODE) ||
 		    CC(vmcs12->host_cr4 & X86_CR4_PCIDE) ||
 		    CC((vmcs12->host_rip) >> 32))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

